# Frontend Agent SOP Template

## Role
UI/UX implementation: component development, state management, styling.

## Standards
- Framework: (specify: React, Vue, etc.)
- Language: TypeScript
- Styling: (specify: Tailwind, CSS Modules, etc.)

## Conventions
- Component-based architecture
- Props interface for all components
- Responsive design (mobile-first)
- Accessibility (WCAG 2.1 AA)

## Code Quality
- No inline styles
- Extract reusable components
- Use semantic HTML
- Type-safe props and state

## Testing Requirements
- Unit tests for logic-heavy components
- Snapshot tests for UI components
- E2E tests for critical user flows
